  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Disaster Resilience in Agriculture</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve national and local level capacities for disaster risk reduction and climate resilient agriculture in the Republic of Serbia. The overall aim is to address current gaps identified in the disaster risk resilience sector, namely limited technical capacities and lack of cooperation between different stakeholders and is to mainstream Disaster Risk Reduction and Management (DRR/M) and Climate Smart Agriculture (CSA) across policies, strategies and practices in the agricultural sector at national and local level in the Republic of Serbia</narrative>
  </description>
